flowchart TB
  U[Submitted URL] --> A["acquire(url, write)<br/>Write HTML + multiple images<br/>Returns Artifact[]"]
  A <-->|write / Artifact| N["write(metadata, bytes)<br/>Returns Artifact<br/>One stored file per call"]
  A -->|"Artifact[]"| H[Trusted host ingestion<br/>Assign IDs / hash / store bytes<br/>Complete Input atomically]
  B[Files / folders / pasted text<br/>Browser capture with bytes] -->|bypass URL acquisition| H
  H -->|Input: stored originals only| P["process(input, {read, write})<br/>Returns Publication[]<br/>Untrusted worker"]
  P -->|"Publication[]"| V[Trusted host publication<br/>Validate all artifact memberships<br/>Store plugin-supplied search strings]
  V --> S[Host storage + per-item artifact sets<br/>Explicit sharing allowed]
  S --> UI[Trusted host UI per item<br/>Search + readable fallback<br/>Broker checks item membership]
  UI <-->|MessagePort: artifact reads only| F[Optional untrusted iframe<br/>Load and parse plugin-owned files]
  W[Artifact processor worker<br/>Dynamic Worker; no ambient network<br/>Scoped host operations]
